{"data":{"body":"[P2] Apply the preview cap before serializing a mask value\n\nParser constraints bound values read from JSON, but a configured `maskString` bypasses them. `writeValueAsBytes` materializes that entire candidate before comparing it with `maxPreviewBytes`, so a tiny preview budget can still cause an unbounded duplicate allocation and OOM. Measure with a capped output stream, or reject oversized masks using bounded UTF-8 measurement, and add a constrained-heap regression.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7okjs-","finding_digest":"5569849aaa6f231cfcab68b6fef126eb700831658d28e1c3d0a4d8d653c1b3aa","finding_id":"arf_v1_kvuyjgvkn4rrz7flnc3p54jg5n","finding_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","identity_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","line":436,"observation_digest":"e7d761bc456bec1cc3deaaaaf085cd72774b4c46763b94a9725c35ff780ea3ac","observation_id":"aro_v1_47lwdpcfnpwbzq66vkvpbbonoj","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/SerDesPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kvuyjgvkn4rrz7flnc3p54jg5n","published_at":"2026-09-01T07:45:43Z","review_id":"arr_v1_k6bplylnyv7iudtqnda6ta7a7f","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"3904338dc683c8076b0fa0c2415a1e06223975c5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":436,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_ibbgq7g5bdsabx4wytwpzqoh6c","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T07:45:43Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
